    if id == 2 { return GeneticCode { 2, "FFLLSSSSYY**CCWWLLLLPPPPHHQQRRRRIIMMTTTTNNKKSS**VVVVAAAADDEEGGGG", "0000000000000000000000000000000011110000000000000001000000000000", "0000000000110000000000000000000000000000000000110000000000000000", false }; }
