    if id == 4 { return GeneticCode { 4, "FFLLSSSSYY**CCWWLLLLPPPPHHQQRRRRIIIMTTTTNNKKSSRRVVVVAAAADDEEGGGG", "0011000000000000000100000000000011110000000000000001000000000000", "0000000000110000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000", false }; }
